--- text
[INVITER_NAME] invited you to join [TEAM_NAME]

[INVITER_NAME] ([INVITER_EMAIL]) invited you to join the team
[TEAM_NAME] on [PRODUCT_NAME], with the role [ROLE_NAME]. Accepting
adds [EMAIL_ADDRESS] to that team.

Invitation details

Invited by: [INVITER_NAME]
Team: [TEAM_NAME]
Your role: [ROLE_NAME]

Accept the invitation:

[CTA_URL]

This invitation expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE], which is
[EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it was sent. After that the link stops
working, and [INVITER_NAME] would have to send a new one.

If you do not want to join, there is nothing to do. The invitation
expires on its own, and you are not added to [TEAM_NAME]. If you
would rather not be invited again, tell [INVITER_EMAIL] you are not
interested.

Not sure whether this invitation is genuine? Reply to this email, or
write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
